      "type": "PHYSICAL",
      "sku": "ST-28695",
      "description": "<h2>HTDZ HT-81A Professional Shotgun Microphone</h2><p>The HTDZ HT-81A Professional Shotgun <a href=\"https://www.startech.com.bd/accessories/microphone\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" target=\"\">Microphone </a>can be applied to lecterns, theater, and video recordings. The mics are incredibly portable and durable, making them perfect for installation on cameras or camcorders. They can be utilized outdoors, in studios, with fish pole booms, or as portable devices. An outstanding polar pattern with high sensitivity is produced by the electrostatic transducer element and the unidirectional polar pattern. The HTDZ HT-81A Professional Shotgun Microphone with extended frequency response and Phantom Power is the HTDZ HT-81A Shotgun style electret condenser microphone. The extremely focused pick-up pattern used in many live theater, television, film, and video productions, as well as in live broadcasts, is built with both powered and battery options. A body switch for the HTDZ HT-81A Professional Shotgun Microphone's OFF, NORMAL, and TELE modes is included. For improved long-distance pickup, the polar pattern is ultra-directional in TELE mode.</p><h2>Buy HTDZ HT-81A Professional Shotgun Microphone from Deshi Plus</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can get original<a href=\"https://www.startech.com.bd/htdz-ht-81a-professional-shotgun-microphone\" target=\"\"> HTDZ HT-81A Professional Shotgun Microphone</a> From Deshi Plus. We have a large collection of <a href=\"https://www.startech.com.bd/htdz-conference-system\" target=\"\">Htdz Conference Systems</a> to purchase. Order Online Or Visit your Nearest <a href=\"https://www.startech.com.bd/\" target=\"\">Deshi Plus</a> Shop to get yours at lowest price. The HTDZ HT-81A Professional Shotgun Microphone comes with 1 year warranty.</p>",
      "shortDesc": "<h2>Key Features</h2>\n<ul><li>Model: HT-81A</li><li>Polar Pattern: Unidirectional / Ultra Unidirectional</li><li>Output Impedance (Ohm): 75 – Balanced</li><li>Sensitivity (±2dB): NORMAL -45dB, TELE -38dB</li><li>Mic Length (Mm): 360mm</li></ul>",
